{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063902/block/singleImage/3267828/wm/01M7FH39D9NHGE6N4XSPN88246.JPG?updatedAt=1794743953\"/><figcaption>MIAMI QUAY迄今累沽586伙，套現逾62億元。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>會德豐地產與恒基地產 (012) 、新世界發展 (017) 及帝國集團合作發展的「 MIAMI QUAY 」今日以招標形式售出 1 伙，單位為「 MIAMI QUAY I 」第 2 座 3 樓 A 室，屬兩房連儲物室 ( 開放式廚房 ) 間隔，實用面積 487 方呎，成交價 1,205.6 萬元，呎價 24,756 元。 發展商表示，「 MIAMI QUAY 」自現樓開放以來，銷情持續熾熱，項目迄今累沽 586 伙，套現逾 62 億元。 即睇啟德新盤 MIAMI QUAY I 最新資訊 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:43:16.283635+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T17:38:34.379046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:36:43.550654+00:00","content_hash":"f449a47bc251e303fec0de47209041af5f43a1fecb7c7ac23d332662c846fb31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}